# Layout and ignore list adapted from claude-token-optimizer
# (github.com/nadimtuhin/claude-token-optimizer, MIT, (c) 2025 Nadim Tuhin).
# Claude Code does not read this file by itself; its read-guard hook enforces it.

# Finished tasks, old sessions, archived docs: read only when asked
.claude/completions/**
.claude/sessions/**
docs/archive/**

# User-facing docs (CLAUDE.md covers sessions)
README.md
AGENTS.md
LICENSE

# Git
.git/**

# Rust build output
target/**
debug/**
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
**/mutants.out*/**
rustc-ice-*.txt

# Game data, dumps, caches (must never be in the repo anyway)
*.rpf
*.xvd
*.ttpf
*.exe
*.dll
*.zip

# Environment
.env
.env.*

# Logs
*.log
logs/**
